# Design system

- Follow `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`. Do not add a product name, logo, or wordmark.
- Use Fraunces for café names and page titles, and Source Sans 3 for interface text.
- Use the paper, ink, and oxide tokens. Oxide is the only accent and stays rare.
- The exploration screen is a map with a bottom sheet of results. The list must work when the map cannot.
- Icon-only controls need accessible names. Tap targets are at least 44px. Keep visible focus.
- Show a photo only when the record has a URL, alt text, attribution, and a license.
- Empty and denied copy stays plain: “Not listed”, “Saved on this device only”, “Location is off. You can still search and browse the map.”
- Do not add decorative coffee icons, a second accent, or stock images presented as the café.
